1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,481
To bring a molecule up to the surface, work must be done against that inward pull.

2
00:00:05,481 --> 00:00:09,843
So a liquid keeps its surface area as small as it possibly can.

3
00:00:09,843 --> 00:00:17,252
That is why a free drop of rain pulls itself into a sphere, the shape with the least surface for its volume.

